  "metadata": {
    "title": "N-grams shorten history so we can count",
    "description": "The exact chain rule conditions each word on its entire preceding history. N-gram models apply an (N\u22121)-order Markov assumption, using only the last N\u22121 words; shorter histories repeat more often in a corpus but lose context."
  }
